     "name": "mode",
     "type": "string",
     "optional": true,
     "description": "The id of the mode in force. Controlled when defined: Apply only reports through onModeChange, and you pass the\nnew mode (with `reason` and `until`) back. Otherwise the component applies it, starting from `defaultMode`"
